  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ethiopia National Dialogue Support Project is implemented by the Association for Inclusive Peace, and it aims to prepare and conduct a National Dialogue process. The objective is to support key Ethiopian stakeholders, including but not limited to the Multi Institutions National Dialogue (MIND) Consortium.  Key activities include creating and facilitating a conducive environment for dialogue, and capturing of key lessons from the process for use globally.</narrative>
